---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Link from "../components/Link.astro";
---

<Base
  title="All Projects — Alejandro Martínez"
  description="Full grid of production work across AI, Bitcoin infrastructure, DeFi protocols, trading systems, civic tech, and OSS dev tools."
>
  <div class="page">

    <!-- ── TOP BAR ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <header class="topbar">
      <div class="prompt">
        <span class="prompt-path">~/portfolio</span>
        <span class="prompt-sigil">$</span>
        <span class="prompt-cmd">ls projects</span>
      </div>
      <nav class="nav">
        <Link href="/">home</Link>
        <Link href="/about">about</Link>
        <Link href="/oss">oss</Link>
        <Link href="/cv">cv</Link>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- ── HERO ────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-tag">ALL PROJECTS · 11</div>
      <h1 class="hero-h1">Everything I've shipped.</h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">
        Production work across AI, Bitcoin infrastructure, DeFi protocols, trading systems, civic tech, and OSS dev tools.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- ── CLUSTER: AI / AGENT SYSTEMS ─────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="cluster">
      <div class="cluster-label">AI / AGENT SYSTEMS</div>
      <div class="grid">

        <div class="grid-item">
          <div class="item-header">
            <div class="item-idx">01</div>
            <div class="item-name">Trilo</div>
            <Link href="/cases/trilo" class="case-badge">→ case study</Link>
          </div>
          <p class="item-blurb">An AI workspace where autonomous coworkers participate as teammates, with persistent memory, a queryable knowledge graph and a native MCP server. Custom DAG workflow orchestrator and dual-tier model routing inside. Live at trilo.chat across web, mobile and a Python voice agent.</p>
          <div class="item-stack">TypeScript · Rust · Python · Bun · Elysia · Tauri · MCP</div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-item">
          <div class="item-header">
            <div class="item-idx">02</div>
            <div class="item-name">Chatvue</div>
          </div>
          <p class="item-blurb">AI persona SaaS for Fanvue creators. Autonomous subscriber engagement: a 6-stage state machine drives conversation, a whale-judge LLM ranks high-value subs, and the AI itself decides when to send PPV content. Two-tier compliance routing (regex → Gemini Flash) and non-custodial USDT wallets via HD derivation.</p>
          <div class="item-stack">TypeScript · Next.js · tRPC · Drizzle · OpenRouter · Opik · Tauri</div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── CLUSTER: BITCOIN & BLOCKCHAIN INFRA ──────────────────────── -->
    <section class="cluster">
      <div class="cluster-label">BITCOIN & BLOCKCHAIN INFRA</div>
      <div class="grid">

        <div class="grid-item">
          <div class="item-header">
            <div class="item-idx">03</div>
            <div class="item-name">Satstream</div>
            <Link href="/cases/satstream" class="case-badge">→ case study</Link>
          </div>
          <p class="item-blurb">Bitcoin's data layer. 9 repos, 4 indexers, 5-language SDK, MCP server, block explorer. Indexes the full Bitcoin chain (~3 TB) into a MongoDB + ScyllaDB + Postgres + Redis cluster for sub-second queries.</p>
          <div class="item-stack">Rust · Go · Python · ScyllaDB · MongoDB · gRPC · AWS CDK</div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── CLUSTER: DEFI / CROSS-CHAIN ──────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="cluster">
      <div class="cluster-label">DEFI / CROSS-CHAIN</div>
      <div class="grid">

        <div class="grid-item">
          <div class="item-header">
            <div class="item-idx">05</div>
            <div class="item-name">Crossflow Network</div>
            <Link href="/cases/crossflow" class="case-badge">→ case study</Link>
          </div>
          <p class="item-blurb">L1 Cosmos SDK chain with TSS/MPC-ECDSA implementation. Gennaro-Goldfeder CCS 2018 (Feldman VSS, Paillier, Schnorr/DLN ZK proofs), HTLC scripts BTC, BandChain oracle via IBC.</p>
          <div class="item-stack">Go · Cosmos SDK · CosmWasm · TSS/MPC · secp256k1</div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── CLUSTER: TRADING SYSTEMS ─────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="cluster">
      <div class="cluster-label">TRADING SYSTEMS</div>
      <div class="grid">

        <div class="grid-item">
          <div class="item-header">
            <div class="item-idx">07</div>
            <div class="item-name">Compound Fox + Autowealth</div>
          </div>
          <p class="item-blurb">Algo strategy with a live, public performance dashboard — full equity curve, Sharpe and drawdown updated in real time. Plus a SaaS distribution platform: Turborepo with backend, Telegram bot, Next dashboards, React Native, AWS CDK.</p>
          <div class="item-stack">TypeScript · Bun · Python · Jesse · Bybit API · AWS CDK</div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-item">
          <div class="item-header">
            <div class="item-idx">08</div>
            <div class="item-name">Copy Trader</div>
          </div>
          <p class="item-blurb">Real-money copy trading infrastructure in Rust. Copies master-account trades to multiple followers via WebSocket. Bybit (full), Binance, Hyperliquid modules. AWS ECS deploy, Prometheus, Teloxide alerts.</p>
          <div class="item-stack">Rust · Tokio · Diesel · WebSocket · AWS CDK · Bybit API</div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── CLUSTER: CIVIC TECH & SAAS ───────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="cluster">
      <div class="cluster-label">CIVIC TECH & SAAS</div>
      <div class="grid">

        <div class="grid-item">
          <div class="item-header">
            <div class="item-idx">09</div>
            <div class="item-name">Ley Abierta</div>
            <Link href="/cases/leyabierta" class="case-badge">→ case study</Link>
          </div>
          <p class="item-blurb">190 years of Spanish legislation as Git — 12,255 laws, 42,866 commits. Hybrid BM25 + RAG retrieval with a custom int8 SIMD C kernel: Recall@5 from 2% to 66% on real citizen queries, median latency from ~120s to sub-second. Live at leyabierta.es.</p>
          <div class="item-stack">TypeScript · Bun · SQLite + FTS5 · C SIMD · Qwen · AGPL-3.0</div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-item">
          <div class="item-header">
            <div class="item-idx">10</div>
            <div class="item-name">Tecpar</div>
          </div>
          <p class="item-blurb">Sole engineer behind Tecpar's full platform: internal admin for technicians, client portal, online shop, and public site. Four Next.js apps sharing one Postgres database, fully self-hosted with blue/green deploys. The system handles the entire order lifecycle — emails, repairs, shipping, invoicing. Live at tecpar.es.</p>
          <div class="item-stack">TypeScript · Next.js · Prisma · tRPC · Traefik · Docker</div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-item">
          <div class="item-header">
            <div class="item-idx">11</div>
            <div class="item-name">LEB — Local Expats Bali</div>
          </div>
          <p class="item-blurb">Client project: events and membership platform for the expat community in Bali. Turborepo monorepo with four apps — Expo React Native, Next.js admin, member zone, and landing. Membership tiers, partner discount system, and Mapbox venue discovery.</p>
          <div class="item-stack">TypeScript · Expo · Next.js · Supabase · Mapbox</div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-item">
          <div class="item-header">
            <div class="item-idx">12</div>
            <div class="item-name">Asset Reality</div>
            <Link href="/cases/asset-reality" class="case-badge">→ case study</Link>
          </div>
          <p class="item-blurb">19 months as engineer at a government-grade crypto custody startup. Owned the multi-sig governance/escrow engine and the 12-chain blockchain ingestion platform. Platform AUM $200–300M during tenure ($1B+ now in seizures).</p>
          <div class="item-stack">Go · TypeScript · MongoDB · RabbitMQ · Fireblocks · AWS · Terraform</div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── FOOTER ────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <footer class="footer">
      <span class="footer-left">alejandro martinez · @lyricalstring · oss under konar technologies</span>
      <span class="footer-links">
        <Link href="https://github.com/lyricalstring">github</Link>
        <Link href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/lyricalstring/">linkedin</Link>
        <Link href="https://x.com/lyricalstring">x</Link>
        <Link href="mailto:alex@konar.es">email →</Link>
      </span>
    </footer>

  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .page {
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 28px 32px 56px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  /* ── TOP BAR ── */
  .topbar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .prompt {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
    align-items: baseline;
  }

  .prompt-path { color: var(--dim); }
  .prompt-sigil { color: var(--faint); }
  .prompt-cmd { color: var(--fg); }

  .nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: 28px;
    color: var(--dim);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  /* ── HERO ── */
  .hero {
    padding-top: 64px;
    padding-bottom: 48px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .hero-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--faint);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .hero-h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 48px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }

  .hero-lead {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--dim);
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 680px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  /* ── CLUSTERS ── */
  .cluster {
    margin-top: 56px;
    padding-top: 28px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .cluster-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--faint);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 0 56px;
  }

  .grid-item {
    padding: 20px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .item-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .item-idx {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--faint);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .item-name {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--fg);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .case-badge {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 120ms ease;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .case-badge:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .item-blurb {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--dim);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }

  .item-stack {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--faint);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  /* ── FOOTER ── */
  .footer {
    margin-top: 96px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--faint);
  }

  .footer-left { color: var(--faint); }

  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    color: var(--dim);
  }
</style>
